{"script":"s_2_11_1_n","des":"材料足够了。","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“铁箭”莱米","text":"[show]材料好像还不够哦。同志刚刚说一共需要 3 个木板和 1 块石砖吧！[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“铁箭”莱米","text":"[show]没事，也不必太急躁。像是吊床这种亲手制作的礼物，确实要花点时间去准备。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_6"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"“铁箭”莱米","text":"[show]嘻嘻……好期待菲莉娜小姐收到礼物时候的样子呢……嘻嘻……[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_7"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"","text":"[hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}]}